<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Email Verified</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a, #9333ea);
      color: #f1f5f9;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .card {
      background-color: #1e293b;
      padding: 3rem 4rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 400px;
    }

    .card h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      color: #22c55e;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .card p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    .card a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      background-color: #9333ea;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .card a:hover {
      background-color: #7e22ce;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>✅ Email Verified Successfully!</h1>
    <p>You can now log in and enjoy the features of our application.</p>
    <a href="/login">Go to Login</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
